# Flight Crew Alertness: Privacy Policy

**Effective date:** 06/10/2026
**App:** Flight Crew Alertness (iPadOS)
**Owner:** Alliance Airlines (internal tool)
**Contact:** itservicedesk@allianceairlines.com.au

---

## Summary (plain English)

- The app lets Alliance Airlines flight crew submit crew alertness reports from a company iPad.
- There is no account and no sign-in. The app does not ask who you are.
- Reports are not linked to an individual crew member.
- Reports are sent securely to Alliance Airlines and used for fatigue risk management and safety compliance.
- We do not sell your data or share it with advertisers. The app has no ads and no tracking.
- This is a private enterprise app for Alliance Airlines personnel, not for consumer use.

---

## Scope

This policy covers the Flight Crew Alertness app and the Alliance Airlines systems that receive its reports.

