## Anonymity

The app is designed so that a report cannot be traced back to an individual crew member. Please avoid typing your name or other identifying details into free-text fields, because anything you type is sent as part of the report.

---

## Third Parties

We do not sell or share report data with third parties for their own purposes. Report data is processed only within Alliance Airlines' own systems and the cloud services Alliance Airlines uses to run them.

---

## Your Choices and Rights

Because reports are anonymous, Alliance Airlines usually cannot tell which report is yours, which limits what can be done to find, correct or delete an individual report. If you have questions or concerns about how reports are handled, contact the address above.

